<view class="container"><view class="demo">本地演练版 · 不产生真实付款或安装权益</view>
<view class="title">先确认电脑 · 能否安装</view><view class="subtitle">手机不能检查电脑的 WSL、磁盘或权限，请在目标电脑完成检查。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="step"><view class="number">1</view><view>在电脑打开 hermes.localvram.cn<button size="mini" bindtap="copy">复制电脑网站地址</button></view></view><view class="step"><view class="number">2</view><view>按照电脑页面指引运行免费检查。</view></view><view class="step"><view class="number">3</view><view>扫描电脑页面的小程序关联码，并在两端确认。</view></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="heading">本地流程演练</view><view class="small">演练不读取电脑环境，不生成真实检查证明。电脑结果页与关联服务待开发。</view><picker range="{{scenarios}}" bindchange="scenario"><view class="input">{{scenarios[selected]}}</view></picker><button bindtap="demo">生成演练检查结果</button><input class="input" placeholder="关联码（演练：DEMO-PASS）" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="link">读取关联结果</button><button bindtap="scan">扫描关联码</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{check}}" class="card"><view class="heading">检查结果：{{statusText}}</view><view class="row">{{check.environment}}</view><view class="row">安装版本：{{check.productVersion}}</view><view class="small">有效至 {{expiresText}} · {{check.confirmed?'已确认关联':'待确认关联'}}</view><view wx:if="{{check.status !== 'PASS'}}" class="error">{{check.status === 'BLOCK'?'示例环境未满足要求，请完成准备后重新检查。':'示例检测未完成，请补充信息或重试。'}}</view><button wx:if="{{check.status === 'PASS'}}" class="primary" bindtap="next">确认关联并查看订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
